    },
    "starRating": "THREE",
    "comment": "La atencion y surtido  del minimarket  muy buena, incluso cenamos alli, pero no habia baños habilitados,  las puertas estaban cerradas, las de todos los baños,teniendo en cuenta que es una de las pocas estaciones yendo por ruta 40  es una pena que no considere esa necesidad basica del cliente.\nEntiendo, tal vez justo llegue en el momento de la limpieza, eran las 21:30 aprox. Tal vez debieran dejar aunque sea 1 baño habilitado mientras se limpia el resto. De verdad que veniamos de muchas horas de viaje y paramos a cargar combustible, comer algo y poder pasar por el sanitario antes de seguir viaje.\n\n(Translated by Google)\nThe service and selection at the minimarket were very good; we even had dinner there. However, there were no working restrooms; all the doors were closed. Considering it\u0027s one of the few stations along Route 40 with open restrooms, it\u0027s a shame they don\u0027t consider this basic customer need.\n\nI understand; perhaps I arrived just as they were cleaning, around 9:30 PM. Perhaps they should at least keep one restroom open while the others are being cleaned. We had been traveling for many hours and stopped to refuel, grab a bite to eat, and use the restroom before continuing our journey.",
    "createTime": "2024-04-08T01:40:43.616103Z",
